  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Oxidation is loss of electron and in a galvanic cell it occurs at anode. Reduction is gain of electron and in a galvanic cell it occurs at cathode.</p><p>At anode :<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#10230;</mo><munder><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>At cathode&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>AgCl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mtext>&#160;(aq)&#160;</mtext></munder></math></p><p>Overall reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Cell representation :</p><p>Anode / Anode electrolyte || Cathodic electrolyte / Cathode.</p><p>The cell representation for the above cell will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>HCl</mi><mfenced><msup><mtext>&#160;soln&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Ag</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
